{"decisions":[{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"One page gathers every report sharing one fingerprint."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"A page's slug is the app that met the error joined to the fingerprint."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"A fingerprint alone is no export name."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"The fields the first report had are the fields the commit has."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"How often and how recently an error was met is kept outside the commit."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"A later report raises the count and leaves the committed body alone."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"Filing an error again commits nothing."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/gap","statement":"A fresh checkout has no count for any error."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/absence","statement":"No stack reaches a page."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/absence","statement":"Nobody who met an error is named here."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/gap","statement":"A message or a url could have a secret."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/absence","statement":"Nothing here takes a secret out of the fields a report carried."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/departure","statement":"An error page goes once the fault the page reports is gone."},{"decisionKind":"decision-kind/absence","statement":"Whether anyone has looked at an error is said nowhere here."}]}
{"definition":"one fault a client met, gathered under the fingerprint the fault hashes to"}
